        "TileImage": "$($repository 3d63160b-1533-4916-b680-8eaeb5e6eec7).Image",
        "Description": "Since waiting on guests at the shisha bar doesn&apos;t pay well, two of the servers have started spiking the pipes with scopolamine as a kind of &quot;truth serum&quot;. They use this to get customers to spill information that they can either sell on or use as blackmail. We have been hired by a member of the Swedish consulate who would like the secrets he spilled to be secret again. You will need to infiltrate the shisha bar and eliminate the two servers, hopefully without arousing suspicion.\rGood Luck 47.",
